msgid "3. Click \"Auto Configure Firewall\" (to allow traffic forwarding)."
msgstr ""
"3. Klikněte na „Automaticky nastavit bránu firewall“ (pro umožnění "
"přeposílání provozu)."

#: applications/luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:765
msgid ""
"3. In the Tailscale admin console, edit this device under the route settings "
"and approve it as an Exit Node."
